{"id":"93870bfe2a48922a","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code.md","title":"ZFC Topo10 Meager Set Code","display":"df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code — ZFC Topo10 Meager Set Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code"],"display":"df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code — ZFC Topo10 Meager Set Code","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code — ZFC Topo10 Meager Set Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4129a86b73f8c630\" href=\"?note=4129a86b73f8c630\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"481582931ea56519\" href=\"?note=481582931ea56519\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"99a7a09e1b39c781\" href=\"?note=99a7a09e1b39c781\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,\\tau,F\\in V\">\\(A,X,\\tau,F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> is the topology predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S\\)</span> is the nowhere-dense predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4129a86b73f8c630\" href=\"?note=4129a86b73f8c630\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-sequence predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopUnionFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopUnionFamily}_S\\)</span> is the family-union predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"481582931ea56519\" href=\"?note=481582931ea56519\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> and function application are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"99a7a09e1b39c781\" href=\"?note=99a7a09e1b39c781\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10MeagerSetCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10MeagerSetCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}meager\\text{-}set\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10MeagerSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(F,\\mathcal P(X))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetopUnionFamily}_S(U,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\n\\land A\\subseteq U\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S(F(n),X,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}meager\\text{-}set\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10MeagerSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(F,\\mathcal P(X))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetopUnionFamily}_S(U,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\n\\land A\\subseteq U\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S(F(n),X,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The fourth argument is now the actual <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-sequence witnessing that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is meager, rather than an untyped auxiliary parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"4129a86b73f8c630","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"